1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.</font>

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,800
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">The ferry leaves at seven,
as it has for forty years.</font>

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="38" color="#ffe0c0"><i>{\an8}<i>[gulls calling]</i></i></font>

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">Tide's turning. We should check
the mooring buoys.</font>

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">The lighthouse keeper logs
every boat that passes.</font>

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,500
<font face="Open Sans" size="38" color="#ffe0c0"><i>{\an8}<i>♪ brass band playing ♪</i></i></font>

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,500
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.</font>

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.</font>

9
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">Keep to the marked channel
past the red buoy.</font>

10
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,000
<font face="Open Sans" size="42">By evening the quay is quiet again.</font>

